---
layout: base.njk
title: Music
description: Music by Joshua Hamsa, with recorded songs and AI-made songs in separate sections.
section: music
permalink: /music/
---
<header class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Songs and sounds</p><h1>Music</h1></header>

<section class="music-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Recorded work</p><h2>Recorded</h2><p>Music I&rsquo;ve recorded, most of it under the name MC Hamsa.</p></div>
<div class="embed-card"><iframe class="audio" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/artist/{{ music.spotifyArtist }}" title="MC Hamsa on Spotify" height="352" loading="lazy" allow="encrypted-media; fullscreen"></iframe><a class="text-action" href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/{{ music.spotifyArtist }}">Listen on Spotify <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
<div class="media-card-grid recorded-grid">{% for song in music.recorded %}{% videoCard song %}{% endfor %}</div></section>

<section class="music-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">An experimental collection</p><h2>Made with AI</h2><p>These songs were made with AI, using Suno.</p></div>
<div class="embed-card"><h3>{{ music.ai.featured.title }}</h3><iframe class="audio" src="https://suno.com/embed/{{ music.ai.featured.id }}" title="{{ music.ai.featured.title }} on Suno" height="240" loading="lazy"></iframe><a class="text-action" href="https://suno.com/song/{{ music.ai.featured.id }}">Listen on Suno <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
<h3 class="subsection-title">Playlists</h3><div class="media-card-grid playlist-grid">{% for list in music.ai.playlists %}<a class="media-card playlist-card" href="https://suno.com/playlist/{{ list.id }}"><span class="card-kicker">Suno playlist</span><span>{{ list.title }}</span><span class="card-action">Open playlist <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>{% endfor %}</div>
<p><a class="text-action" href="{{ music.ai.profile }}">All of my songs on Suno <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></section>
